# The npm package ships only what the `hd` binary needs at run time:
# the CLI entry, the compiler sources (run with --experimental-strip-types),
# the standard library, and the spec chapters `hd explain` reads
# (src/spec-index.ts: spec/README.md, spec/lang/*.md, spec/std/*.md).
# npm always adds package.json and README.md.
*
!bin/
!bin/**
!src/
!src/**
!lib/
!lib/**
!spec/
!spec/README.md
!spec/lang/
!spec/lang/*.md
!spec/std/
!spec/std/*.md
